и пост</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black;text-transform:uppercase'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none"><i><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Б.Гребенщиков<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><i style="mso-bidi-font-style:normal"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>Каподастр
на 2-м ладу<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Вступление</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>: <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A* A6* A7* A6* - 2p.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A Asus4 A/c <span class="GramE">A</span> - 2p.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span>A*<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">              
</span>A6*<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span>A7*<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                  
</span>A6*<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Проснулся
сегодня
утром от
того, что
ползу как
змея,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>*<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">           
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>6*<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>7*<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">           
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>6*<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>При
мне говорят
моё имя, но я
знаю, что это
не я,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">              
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span>D<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                      
</span>A Asus4 A A/c A, A A/c A<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Я
работал всю
жизнь, похоже
- коту под
хвост,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>F<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       
</span>E<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span><span class="GramE">A<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>A</span>/g
A/f# A/f A/e E<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Остаётся
одно -
Молитва и
Пост.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>: <span class="GramE">A</span> Asus4 A A/c A, A A/c A -
2p.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Я
встретился с <span class="SpellE">Миком</span> <span class="SpellE">Джаггером</span>
в "<span class="SpellE">Juan</span> <span class="SpellE">Les</span> <span class="SpellE">Pins</span>" <span class="GramE">на</span>
пляжу,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Он
сидел на
красивом
матрасе и не
видел, как я
лежу,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>А я
лежал рядом,
немногословен
и прост,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Лежал
и думал: «<span class="GramE">Ну</span>
на тебе!, <span class="SpellE">хэй</span>!»
- Молитва и
Пост.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>: <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'> Asus4 A A/c A, A A/c A - 2p.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
